                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data contains the results and coding of a simulation-optimisation model for evaluating several last mile delivery strategies. The main contribution of this paper is the development of a coupled simulation-optimisation framework to find strategies that balance the courier’s economic objectives (delivery efficiency in terms of travel time and distance) and the city’s (traffic flow variability) objectives."
                }
              }
            ]
